    <item>
      <title>Riot Games 联合创始人表示，2XKO 想要生存下去，每月活跃玩家数量需达到“数十万，甚至数百万”</title>
      <link>https://www.ign.com/articles/riot-games-co-founder-says-2xko-needed-hundreds-of-thousands-if-not-millions-of-monthly-active-players-to-survive</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.ign.com/articles/riot-games-co-founder-says-2xko-needed-hundreds-of-thousands-if-not-millions-of-monthly-active-players-to-survive</guid>
